E017_invalid_main_sig.cmm:2:1: semantic error: 'main' must have no parameters and no return type
  |
2 | fn main(a: int) {}
  | ^^^^
what went wrong:
  The 'main' function is the entry point and must take no parameters and
  return nothing.
how to fix:
  Declare it as 'fn main() { ... }'.
      fn main() {
      }
